Rāma dismisses Puṣpaka and enters blossoming Aśōka grove --- Rāma offers Sītā wine amid feasting --- Servants fetch meats fruits and dancers entertain --- Rāma delights Sītā daily through winter --- Rāma does city duties while Sītā serves mothers-in-law --- Rāma hails coming child and asks her wish --- Sītā seeks one night at Gaṅgā hermitages --- Rāma promises tomorrow and exits with friends